msgstr "Broken Link Checker automatically scans your entire site to identify broken links in your content. It monitors both internal links (to other pages on your site) and external links (to other websites). The plugin runs continuous scans to catch new broken links as they appear and comes with a free plan that includes up to 250 links per month."

